OL,3,GNEWSACrime falls to lowest recorded    
OL,4,Alevel but sexual offences up, figures  
OL,5,Ashow                                   
OL,7,FThere has been a significant change in 
OL,8,Fthe composition of offending with big  
OL,9,Fincreases in sexual and violent crime  
OL,10,Fand a steep fall in burglary and theft.
